    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20324" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόμβυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡκος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>silk-worm</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.352f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> insect
				like a wasp, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>silk garment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>deeptoned flute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				57.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				800b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.82
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.713a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cap of a flute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>lowest note</i> on the flute, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1093b3
			</span></i>:—hence 
				Comp.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βομβυκέστερος</span></b> , <i>deeper
				in tone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Lacon.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάμνος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">Hsch.,
					<u>AB</u>1354</span></i>.</div>
